FFI panggil C tanpa sambungan kompil (pantas prototaip!), struct diakses medan, memori diurus manual (bocor jika lupa free!). `ffi.enable=preload` sahaja prod (arbitrary C = RCE!). Ukur dahulu (overhead sempadan!).

```php
$f = new SplFileObject('/data/besar.csv');
$f->setFlags(SplFileObject::READ_CSV | SplFileObject::SKIP_EMPTY | SplFileObject::DROP_NEW_LINE);
$n = 0;
foreach ($f as $baris) {
    if ($baris === [null]) continue;
    proses($baris);
    if (++$n % 10000 === 0) echo "$n\n";
}
```
Flag gabung (`READ_CSV` huraikan petik!, `SKIP_EMPTY` langkau kosong, `DROP_NEW_LINE` bersih!), iterator baris (memori malar!), langkau tajuk dengan `seek(1)`. GB diproses (bukan dimuat!). Had masa CLI diset (`set_time_limit(0)!`).
